      "sense_number": 1,
      "gloss": "culture; cultivation (of cells, bacteria)",
      "explanation": "Growing microorganisms, cells, or tissue under controlled conditions, as in a laboratory. A science and medicine word; also used figuratively for fostering something over time, though that use is literary."
